{"name":"Galactic Federation","hex":"#330077","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"galactic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Relating to a galaxy.\n Relating to the Milky Way galaxy.","Relating to the Milky Way galaxy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/galactic"},{"term":"federation","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of joining together into a single political entity.","An array of nations or states that are unified under one central authority."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of an architectural style popular around the time of federation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/federation"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Curse of Peladon","blocks":[{"text":"The Curse of Peladon is the second serial of the ninth season of the British science fiction television series Doctor Who, which was first broadcast in four weekly parts on BBC1 from 29 January to 19 February 1972."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Curse_of_Peladon"},{"title":"List of Rick and Morty episodes","blocks":[{"text":"Rick and Morty is an American animated science fiction sitcom created by Justin Roiland and Dan Harmon. The series follows Rick Sanchez, an alcoholic, nihilistic mad scientist, and his easily distressed grandson, Morty Smith as they travel to parallel dimensions and exotic planets with extraterrestrials. These adventures commonly cause trouble for Morty's family, who are often dragged along as well."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Rick_and_Morty_episodes"},{"title":"Galactic","blocks":[{"text":"Galactic is an American funk band from New Orleans, Louisiana."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galactic"},{"title":"Federation","blocks":[{"text":"A federation is a union of partially self-governing provinces, states, or other regions under a federal government (federalism). In a federation, the self-governing status of the component units and the division of power between them and the central government are constitutionally entrenched and may not be altered unilaterally by either the central or constituent-unit authorities without following the constitutional amendment process."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Map_of_unitary_and_federal_states.svg/330px-Map_of_unitary_and_federal_states.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federation"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/97/Doctor_Who_and_the_Curse_of_Peladon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/97/Doctor_Who_and_the_Curse_of_Peladon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADoctor_Who_and_the_Curse_of_Peladon.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Nigeria_states.png/500px-Nigeria_states.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Nigeria_states.png/500px-Nigeria_states.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":" A map of the Federal Republic of Nigeria, showing its 36 states and the Federal Capital Territory","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANigeria_states.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Np.png/500px-Np.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Np.png/1280px-Np.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Np.png/500px-Np.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A map of the Federal Democratic Republic o